<FTL>
	<text name="tooltip_sc_strafe_ready">Temporarily increase accuracy and projectile speed by half your evade.</text>
	<text name="tooltip_sc_strafe_manned">Piloting must be manned to activate.</text>

	<text name="stat_bio_weapon">Bio-Weapon: Hull and system damage are negated unless the target ship is organic.</text>
	<text name="stat_rust_weapon">Rust-Weapon: Hull and system damage are negated unless the target ship is automated.</text>
	<text name="stat_fire_fill">Lights all tiles on fire in any room hit</text>
	<text name="stat_breach_fill">Creates a breach on all tiles in any room hit</text>

	<!-- SC WEAPON SCALING -->
	<text name="stat_sc_charge_levels">Charges: \1</text>
	<text name="stat_sc_chainstep_max">Chainsteps: \1</text>
	<text name="stat_sc_accuracy_range">Accuracy Modifier: \1% to \2%</text>
	<text name="stat_sc_breach_range">Breach Chance: \1 - \2%</text>
	<text name="stat_sc_chain_levels">Chains: \1</text>
	<text name="stat_sc_stun_range">Stun Chance: \1 - \2%</text>

	<!-- SC LIVE WEAPON DISPLAY -->
	<text name="render_sc_charge_level_radius">Charge \1/\2 | R: \3</text>
	<text name="render_sc_halo_step_radius">Step \1/\2 | R: \3</text>
	<text name="render_sc_chain_level_radius">Chain \1/\2 | R: \3</text>

	<!-- SC WEAPON TIPS -->
	<text name="tip_sc_charge">Tip: Additional charges increase the number of shots fired and modify the properties of every shot in the volley.</text>
	<text name="tip_sc_chainstep">Tip: Chainstep weapons can fire before reaching full charge. Waiting longer changes the weapon's properties with each additional charge step.</text>
	<text name="tip_sc_chain">Tip: Chain weapons improve or alter their properties with successive volleys. Chain levels reset when the weapon loses power.</text>

	<!-- SC PAIRED WEAPONS -->
	<text name="stat_sc_paired_group">Pairing Group: \1</text>
	<text name="stat_sc_paired_group_gemini_lv1">Gemini Mk I</text>
	<text name="stat_sc_paired_group_gemini_lv2">Gemini Mk II</text>
	<text name="stat_sc_paired_group_gemini_lv3">Gemini Mk III</text>
	<text name="stat_sc_paired_secondary">Required Power: 0
	Missile Cost: 0

	Duplicates the primary weapon's projectiles.
	Charge time and damage are inherited from the primary weapon.</text>

	<!-- SC PAIRED WEAPON DISPLAY -->
	<text name="render_sc_paired_primary">Paired: Primary</text>
	<text name="render_sc_paired_secondary">Paired: Secondary</text>

	<!-- SC PAIRED WEAPON TIPS -->
	<text name="tip_sc_paired">Tip: Place two compatible weapons next to each other. Power the left weapon and leave the right weapon unpowered to fire both weapons using only the primary weapon's power and ammunition.</text>

	<!-- SC EMP WEAPONS -->
	<text name="stat_sc_emp_duration">Crew Drone Stun: \1 sec</text>

	<!-- SC IRRADIATE WEAPONS -->
	<text name="stat_sc_irradiate_damage">Radiation Damage: \1 - \2 HP/s per application</text>
	<text name="stat_sc_irradiate_duration">Radiation Duration: 25 sec</text>
	<text name="stat_sc_irradiate_erosion">Irradiated crew spread erosion to rooms they occupy.</text>

	<!-- SC ARTILLERY WEAPONS -->
	<text name="stat_sc_artillery_base_shots">Base Shots: \1</text>
	<text name="stat_sc_artillery_shot_bonus">Shots per Additional Artillery Level: +1</text>
	<text name="stat_sc_artillery_cooldown_penalty">Cooldown penalty per Missing Power: +\1 sec</text>

	<!-- SC ARTILLERY TIPS -->
	<text name="tip_sc_artillery">Tip: Upgrading artillery increases the number of simultaneous projectiles fired. Keep the artillery system fully powered to minimize its charge time.</text>

	<!-- SC DEFENSE MATRIX DRONES -->
	<text name="stat_sc_active_shield_layers">Shield Layers per Activation: \1</text>

	<!-- SC DRONE TIPS -->
	<text name="tip_sc_active_shield">Tip: Defense Matrix drones generate temporary super shields in response to incoming projectiles and beams.</text>

